      "widgets_values": [
        "## About This WF\n\n\n## Model Links (for Local Users)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3-VL/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/circlestone-labs/Anima/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors)\n\n**Unet**\n\n- [krea2_turbo_fp8.safetensors](https://civitai.com/models/2723583/krea2-turbofp8)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   └── qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 Unet/\n│       └── krea2_turbo_fp8.safetensors\n```\n\nWorkflow by Enzino.\n\nCheck out all my models, Loras, WF, and scripts at:\n\n- [Ko-Fi](https://ko-fi.com/enzinoxl/commissions)\n\n- [www.enzinoai.com](https://www.enzinoai.com)"
      ],
